{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13454","headline":"登庐山峰顶寺 · 刘眘虚","name":"登庐山峰顶寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤峰临万象，秋气何高清。\n天际南郡出，林端西江明。\n山门二缁叟，振锡闻幽声。\n心照有无界，业悬前後生。\n虽知真机静，尚与爱网幷。\n方首金门路，未遑参道情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘眘虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13454.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13454","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}